==Finnish==
[[Image:Finnish_barn.JPG|thumb|150px|Typical Finnish ''lato'']]

===Etymology===
From a {{etyl|gem|fi}} language, compare Swedish {{term|lada|lang=sv}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyphenation|la|to|lang=fi}}
* {{rhymes|ɑto|lang=fi}}
* {{IPA|lang=fi|[ˈlɑt̪o]}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# A [[hovel]], [[barn]] (unheated inexpensively built roofed storage for agricultural equipment or products, especially hay).

====Declension====
{{fi-decl-valo|la|t|d|o|a}}

====Usage notes====
"Barn" may also mean ''[[navetta]]'' or other animal shelter.

